UPGRADE THE SERVICES SECTION INTO A MULTI-PAGE SERVICE SYSTEM.

Use the current website/code as the source of truth. Do NOT redesign the existing website and do NOT change the current visual identity, typography, colors, header, footer, hero, WhatsApp button, or the six official service illustrations.

I want the six service cards in the "Nuestros Servicios" section to become clickable cards that open dedicated service pages.

REFERENCE:
Use the structure and user experience of www.abogadamasri.com as inspiration: their service cards link to dedicated pages where each service receives substantially more detailed content, with navigation back to the main Services section. Do NOT copy their text, branding, colors, or design. Recreate only the concept of having dedicated service pages.

IMPORTANT:
Create REAL ROUTES/PAGES, not modal windows, accordions, popups, or content that merely expands inside the homepage.

Create these six routes:

/servicios/proyectos
/servicios/construccion-obras-civiles
/servicios/remodelaciones-ampliaciones
/servicios/avaluos-peritajes-tecnicos
/servicios/patologia-estructural
/servicios/estabilizacion-taludes

SERVICE CARD BEHAVIOR:

Make the entire service card clickable, not just the title or "Ver más" text.

Each card should:
- have cursor-pointer behavior
- have a subtle professional hover effect
- preserve its existing icon exactly
- preserve its existing title and description
- navigate to the corresponding service page when clicked
- NOT open a new browser tab

Add a subtle "Ver servicio →" indication to each card only if it can be done without making the cards visually cluttered.

DEDICATED SERVICE PAGE STRUCTURE:

Each service page should use the existing website Header and Footer.

At the top of each page include:

1. Breadcrumb navigation:
Inicio / Servicios / [Nombre del servicio]

2. A professional page hero:
- service title
- short introductory paragraph
- the existing official service illustration for that service
- clean white/light background
- maintain the site's existing black, white, gray and gold visual identity

3. A detailed "¿Qué ofrecemos?" or equivalent section explaining the service.

4. A list/grid of the specific services included within that category.

5. A professional CTA section:
"¿Necesitas asesoría para tu proyecto?"
with:
"Solicitar información"
and the existing WhatsApp/contact functionality.

6. A "Servicios relacionados" section containing links to the other relevant service pages.

7. A clear "← Volver a Servicios" link.

CONTENT:

Do not invent technical credentials, certifications, licenses, guarantees, legal claims, or qualifications that are not already present in the current website.

Use the existing descriptions as the starting point and expand them into useful, professional website content while staying factually conservative.

